&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Remote within Europe, with regular presence in Bremen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Model: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote / hybrid. Regular time on-site in Bremen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Mission&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own build, deployment and infrastructure for scientific software that runs in awkward places — customer premises, restricted laboratory networks, air-gapped sites, and our own cloud. The role combines conventional cloud platform engineering with the harder problem of shipping updatable software into environments we do not control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pillar 1 Deployment and Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own build, CI/CD and release for the platform across cloud and on-premise targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain installers and update paths that work in restricted and offline environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage database migration and rollback paths for customer installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Success Metrics and KPIs: release frequency, failed deployments, time to patch a customer site.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pillar 2 Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the Kubernetes and GitOps side of the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own secrets management, access control and infrastructure-as-code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement monitoring and log aggregation across internal and customer environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate with Constructor&#39;s platform, identity and deployment tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Success Metrics and KPIs: uptime, mean time to detect, infrastructure reproducible from code.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pillar 3 Security and Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce static analysis and dependency and licence scanning into the pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own backup, recovery and continuity for the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audit and compliance requirements from funded research and customer contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accountability: no single undocumented dependency on one person, including yourself.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong AWS or equivalent, Kubernetes, and configuration management such as Ansible, at production scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real experience of on-premise and offline deployment, not only cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD pipeline ownership end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous and proactive. You have carried infrastructure alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to hand knowledge over rather than hold it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in the product and the science, not only the pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communicator in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education &amp;amp; Languages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science or engineering, or equivalent practical track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What This Role Is (and Is Not)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role IS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full ownership of infrastructure for a technically unusual product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role where you finally get a team around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to a broad modern stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is NOT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pure cloud or pure on-premise role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A ticket-driven operations role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A role without contact with the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
